---
title: "1Zpresso — K-Plus"
description: "A premium 1Zpresso hand grinder with an external adjustment ring, good for both filter coffee and espresso."
date: "2026-10-27"
tags: ["grinder", "hand grinder"]
brand: "1Zpresso"
category: "Hand grinder"
---

The K-Plus is a step up in the 1Zpresso lineup. The adjustment ring is on the outside with a number scale, so it's easy to switch between a fine espresso grind and a coarser pour over grind and get back to the same setting later.

A great grinder if you switch brew methods a lot. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
